Package: task-master
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: systemd, dbus-user-session, libdecor-0-plugin-1-cairo | libdecor-0-plugin-1-gtk
Description: GPU-rendered system and remote machine monitor
 Native CPU, memory, process, GPU, disk and network monitoring with SSH
 collectors, history and optional per-user background persistence.
 The desktop runs as the logged-in user. A separate headless collector has
 CAP_PERFMON to read hardware energy counters and drops the capability after
 opening those counters.
